What does this program print?

```php
<?php
$a = ["1" => "a", 1 => "b", "01" => "c"];
echo count($a), $a[1], "\n";
```

Called without a callback, `array_filter` removes falsy values. What does this print?

```php
<?php
$n = array_filter([5, 0, 7, 0, 9]);
echo implode(",", array_keys($n)), "\n";
```

What does this program print?

```php
<?php
