foreach ($n as &$v) {
}
foreach ($n as $v) {
}
echo implode(",", $n), "\n";
```

What does this program print?

```php
<?php
$w = ["kiwi", "fig", "apple", "date"];
usort($w, fn($a, $b) => [strlen($a), $a] <=> [strlen($b), $b]);
echo implode(" ", $w), "\n";
```
